      "profile": "HAP session encryption selects ChaCha20-Poly1305",
      "reason": "The wrapper aliases PyCA ChaCha20Poly1305. The rust backend selects the ChaCha20-Poly1305 EVP cipher. The HAP encryption and decryption call sites do not select the AES-GCM-SIV cipher."
    },
