        "121482"
      ],
      "profile": "Raw Ed25519/X25519 HAP keys and JSON pairing store",
      "reason": "The controller sends fixed-type raw keys through TLV. The persisted state decodes JSON and imports raw keys. The typed PyCA methods call the Ed25519/X25519 raw-key APIs. HAP performs no certificate parsing, CRL verification, CMS encryption, or PEM stack accumulation."
    },
