      "profile": "TCP HAP listener and TCP MQTT client",
      "reason": "The production HAP server builds an asyncio TCP protocol. Session framing and authentication are provided by HAP. The local MQTT client is created with default TCP transport. mDNS uses multicast DNS. None of these paths creates a QUIC client, server or stream."
    },
    "tls": {
      "evidence": [
        "opt/sa02m-homekit/sa02m_homekit/bridge.py:153-160",
        "opt/sa02m-homekit/sa02m_homekit/mqtt_link.py:23-34",
