        "pyhap/hap_crypto.py:63-71"
      ],
      "ids": [
        "35190",
        "84786"
      ],
      "profile": "No OpenSSL TLS server, DANE client or Suite B setting in the bridge transport",
      "reason": "The asyncio listener receives no SSLContext. HAP establishes raw X25519 keys, signs with Ed25519 and encrypts frames using ChaCha20-Poly1305. The MQTT client calls connect_async with a host and port and never configures TLS."
    }
